#: main.cpp:118
msgid ""
"A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
"kinstance name.\n"
"This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
"KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
"The final DBus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgstr ""
"En eenkennig Naam för disse Leestekensammeln, normalerwies de KInstance-"
"Naam.\n"
"Dat is \"konqueror\" för Konqueror-Leestekens, \"kfile\" för KFileDialog-"
"Leestekens, usw.\n"
"Op't Enn heet de DBus-Objektpadd \"/KBookmarkManager/dbusObjektNaam\""

